WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Keep your radio on and connected to Wi-Fi. Tap a station in Library.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Enter the Device Code from your radio, then select Add station.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.500
Check that the confirmation numbers on the phone and radio match.

4
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:22.000
On the physical radio, tap Allow. Use Deny for a request you did not start.

5
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.500
On the website, confirm Add station to send the station to your radio.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.000
Wait for Station added successfully! Linked phones can choose their radio directly.
